From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:51:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] HD packs: Automatic = 2x else 4x, per-mode budgets (config
 keys), per-slot palette guard, tuning rows; frame_hook call after the flip

- port_settings: hd_textures "Automatic" (2x if installed, else 4x), enemy density cost hints {None, Medium, High, High}, view distance {None, Medium, Medium}
- hd_texture_pack / gl_hd_textures: default budget per mode (2x 32 MB, 4x 48 MB) with hd_budget_mb / hd_budget_2x_mb / hd_budget_4x_mb;
  palette-slot guard (slot = canonical texel + clut address + size; 3 quick changes, then the original until 600 quiet frames);
  warning when the Vita's texpack_4x.bin is bigger than 160 MB
- hle_media: the profile frame_hook runs after each flip
- tests: port_settings_tests cover the rows and hints

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

